message: "If you use this code or the comparison protocol, cite it as below."
title: "nnU-Net vs Swin UNETR: a small, reproducible 3D medical segmentation benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible comparison of nnU-Net v2 and MONAI Swin UNETR on 3D medical
  volumes, with a shared fixed split, identical metrics, and gradient-based
  explainability of both models' predictions.
